+        /// The plain-edge assertion at the end is separate and applies to both. Every other
+        /// referrer test asserts an edge the EPHEMERON pass produces, so without it, deleting the
+        /// condemned-set lookup from HANDLE_PTR -- the descriptor-driven half of the scan, i.e.
+        /// every referrer that is not a ConditionalWeakTable value -- left every leg green.
