+        /// So: arm the request with a refusal, take a precise allocation-bytes reading, and require
+        /// stat kind 11 to be UNCHANGED; then collect and require it to advance. Serving the
+        /// request from a stop-the-world hook inverts both halves.
+        /// </summary>
