+                $"GC.GetTotalAllocatedBytes(precise: true) stops the world WITHOUT collecting, but it consumed the armed referrer-scan request: kind 11 was {armed} and is now {afterPreciseStw}. The scan is being served from a stop-the-world hook instead of from collection completion (sgen_client_collection_end), so it can run on an unswept heap -- before sgen_client_clear_unreachable_ephemerons -- and report dead-key or unreachable-garbage edges.");
