+ * LOCK NESTING: alcs_lock is held across alc_foreach_teardown_manager, which takes a context's
+ * memory-managers lock beneath it. That is the only direction this file ever nests the two
+ * (mono_alc_cleanup takes the managers lock under the loader lock, never under alcs_lock).
