+ * Exactly one half of that is checkable inside the walk, and the definition in sgen-mono.c says
+ * which and why: STOPPED is asserted and is the tripwire against moving the call site, while
+ * FINISHED and MAJOR are unassertable there and are established by the call site alone. Do not
+ * add either assertion.
