+ * COMPLETENESS, which is what an unsaturated EMPTY result rests on. Descriptor scanning alone is
+ * NOT exhaustive -- ConditionalWeakTable / DependentHandle value edges are invisible to it, for
+ * the reason given under TWO PASSES in the consumer's contract block -- so the scan runs a SECOND
+ * pass over ephemeron_list at the same stopped-world point and reports those edges with
+ * `dependent` set. Root classes the collector marks outside object descriptors and outside
+ * ephemerons -- thread stacks and registers, native structures -- remain outside this walk, and
+ * outside what an empty result can claim.
+ */
+
+/* Referrers described per witness before further hits on that witness are counted but not
